## Document outline

1. [Trigger phrase](#trigger) — how the user asks for a new grid.
2. [Shared chrome (required)](#chrome) — modules every Basic practice must use.
3. [Column contract](#columns) — `user_input_cols` vs `other_shown_cols`.
