<h2 id="checklist" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">6. Checklist</h2>

- [ ] Suite config: Basic practice unheld + `pathPrefixes` if needed.
- [ ] Routes under `/practice/...` mirroring `/knowledge/...`.
- [ ] Shared chrome modules used; page root has `basic-practice-grid`.
- [ ] `PracticeGroupedTable` used; header-class and at least two Grouping Note band-class assertions pass.
- [ ] Content registry + API submit wired through **`record_attempt`**; client sends canonical `MODE_CONTENT_TYPE` mode and any route/chip alias is separately tested.
- [ ] Vitest (or Playwright mocked) for path parse, columns, shared header/band classes, Submit label, and exact submit mode/payload.
- [ ] File header + short comments on non-obvious grading.
